  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tuvalu Fisheries Support - 2026 to 2030</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To continue supporting the Tuvalu Fisheries&#xa0;Authority with grant funding and technical assistance.
This activity will enhance the ability of the TFA to ensure that Tuvalu&apos;s fisheries resources are sustainable and well managed, and that social and economic returns from fisheries revenue are maximised.</narrative>
  </description>
